<http://data.silknow.org/object/6f4c400a-a471-3357-836d-51b5252f1d17>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Embroidered in tent stitch in polychrome wools and silks on natural-colored linen canvas.  In a landscape setting, the sacrifice of Isaac. Abraham stands in the center, one hand resting on Isaac's head, the other, holding a knife, outstretched. In the upper left corner, the angel, encircled by a cloud. On the right, a man lening on a staff, a horse, and in the distance, a castle. At the left edge, the head and two front legs of a lamb. Two flying birds and a butterfly. Worn, embroidery yarns rotted out in many places, holes."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/9181a5cd-8338-3ec5-939b-80e2631f199f> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Embroidered in tent stitch in polychrome wools and silks on natural-colored linen canvas.  In a landscape setting, the sacrifice of Isaac. Abraham stands in the center, one hand resting on Isaac's head, the other, holding a knife, outstretched. In the upper left corner, the angel, encircled by a cloud. On the right, a man lening on a staff, a horse, and in the distance, a castle. At the left edge, the head and two front legs of a lamb. Two flying birds and a butterfly. Worn, embroidery yarns rotted out in many places, holes."@en ;
